{"id":"iimxejhxkse9v7b5udaeq01rb","title":"全息海洋之连通与转捩：临界交互与析构解耦","originalTitle":"复杂系统科学全息观&#8226;全息海洋之连通与转捩：临界交互与析构解耦（续）","summary":"海洋的连通结构由拉格朗日相干结构刻画，当AMOC的流函数场从双稳态滑向另一个时，原本分隔的水体域可能突然连通。这一过程对应双曲不变流形的碰撞或消失，输运壁垒的拓扑结构发生相变。观测设计应聚焦于连通通量而非状态场，以更早检测连通结构的编码关系失效。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3278564&do=blog&id=1561176"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T10:10:32.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T15:12:31.991Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T15:12:31.991Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["研究成果"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6a78c1eb-7c05-45d4-a7a9-4ede2a505fa8","title":"全息海洋连通结构相变与观测方法革新"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6a78c1eb-7c05-45d4-a7a9-4ede2a505fa8","title":"全息海洋连通结构相变与观测方法革新"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f4SFODCgEmfQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}